# Microsoft Clarity analytics

When analyzing site UX, friction, or conversion issues for StellixSoft, use the project MCP server **clarity-stellixsoft**.

## Available tools
- `query-analytics-dashboard` — traffic, browsers, devices, countries, session metrics
- `list-session-recordings` — filter recordings (dead clicks, rage clicks, errors, device, URL)
- `query-documentation-resources` — Clarity product docs

## Limits
- ~10 API requests per day per project
- Prefer focused, single-intent queries; avoid broad multi-day dumps
- Token lives in `.env.local` as `CLARITY_API_TOKEN` (never commit the real value)

## Project
- Tracking project ID: `w84jf5u0ln` (site snippet in `src/components/analytics/MicrosoftClarity.tsx`)
